# coordconverterbrk

A small Python package to convert geographic coordinates between
**Degrees–Minutes–Seconds (DMS)** and **Decimal Degrees**.

> **Final PyPI name:** `coordconverterbrk`

## Install
```bash
pip install coordconverterbrk
